{"full":"hf:maomao88/visualize_attention_for_translation_en_zh","spaceId":"maomao88/visualize_attention_for_translation_en_zh","name":"Attention Visualization for Translation","source":"huggingface","description":"Visualize attention in translation(EN-ZH)","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","attention","visualization","translation","cross-attention","self-attention","transformer","encoder-decoder","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":9,"created":"2025-04-12T06:14:54.000Z","updated":"2025-05-05T05:33:18.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://maomao88-visualize-attention-for-translation-en-zh.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/maomao88/visualize_attention_for_translation_en_zh","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:58:57.515Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T17:58:57.515Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T17:58:57.515Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"👀","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This app aims to help users better understand the behavior behind the attention layers in transformer models by visualizing the cross-attention and self-attention weights in an encoder-decoder model to see the alignment between and within the source and target tokens.","The app leverages the Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-zh model to perform translation tasks from English to Chinese and by setting outputattentions=True, the attention weights are stored as follows:","By taking the weights from the last encoder and decoder layers and calculating the mean over all of the attention heads, the attention weights (avg over heads) are obtained to build attention visualization."],"features":["attentionweights = softmax(Q @ K.T / sqrt(dk)) - A probability distribution over all keys (i.e., tokens being attended to) for each query (i.e., the current token).","(layers, B, heads, srclen, srclen) - e.g. (6, 1, 8, 24, 18)"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/maomao88/visu